WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.860
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:18.490
The Aikatsu Ranking concluded, 
and Venus Ark's planned closing date drew closer.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.540
I was really worried that it would actually happen,

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.630
but thankfully, Elza-san hadn't lost her passion for Aikatsu.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.010
Their performance afterwards was simply dazzling.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:37.260
As Neo Venus Ark, Elza-san and her idols set off on a journey for new Aikatsu.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.810
Onward!

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.460
Morning, girls!

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.840
Good morning, Yuzu.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.880
Good morning, Lilienne!

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.760
That scared me.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.510
I thought my heart would stop!

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.020
Expect the unexpected!

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.400
I didn't think you'd actually know I was coming, Lilienne. You're too good.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.020
I've known you far too long for that.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.740
It's still amazing how Yuzu-senpai didn't even make her flinch.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:37.410
Lily-senpai might have a stronger heart than we gave her credit for.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:41.530
Speaking of, Lily-senpai. Are you okay to run like this?

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.410
I am.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:50.380
Ever since I last returned to Four Star Academy, I've had fewer attacks and have been able to enjoy my time here.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.130
However, that will soon come to an end.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:58.890
Yuzu and I are nearing the end of our three years.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.260
Graduation is coming up soon.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:09.150
Yes. For me, the upcoming 
S4 Selection will be my final battle.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:15.030
I must use every ounce of my ability to achieve my dream of joining S4.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.610
<b>27th Selection</b>

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.610
<b>27th Selection</b>

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.610
<b>27th Selection</b>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:19.910
Meanwhile, I'm gonna end up on top of 
Dance Class and claim my third consecutive win!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.030
No! No! No!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.410
Haruka☆Luka?!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:29.790
Yuzu-senpai, it will be I who claims victory, Haruka☆Luka!

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.880
Try and stop me if you can!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.350
Dance Class is always...

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.060
Rather unique, in its own way.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.230
I have no plans of handing over Song Class's seat either!{I know it's a literally and that we haven't been using it, but it fits}

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:52.560
Lily-senpai, Rola! Let's make this a good match!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.690
I accept your challenge.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.740
Yume... I'm sorry.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:02.240
I don't plan on participating in the next S4 Selection.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.130
Black Star?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:49.140
Yeah. He's a famous music producer from England.{we should maybe use great britain to accurate more but I'm sure they don't the difference}{I get it, but}

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.560
Won't you join me and take on the world?

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.690
He invited me to join him.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:59.110
I'm going to move to England this spring and make my debut there.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.280
Huh?! It's a done deal?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.610
Yeah. I'm sorry, Yume.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:09.530
But once I'm there, I'll go from live house to live house, doing my Aikatsu.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.910
There's no guarantee it'll work out...

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.920
But when I close my eyes, I can hear what my heart is saying.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:16.920
And then!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:22.460
My heart screams out loud that it wants to go! {what is this, the masterpiece movie by Okada Mari, kokoro ga sakebitagatterunda?}

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.930
I think you should do it. Everyone has their own way of shining.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.470
Yume...

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.560
Doing what you want to is the best!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.220
It's as she says.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.640
The great Chinese thinker Lu Xun once said:

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:43.230
"There is no need to look back, for before you lie countless roads to take." {again, a very well known quote in japanese that I can't find in chinese or english}

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.990
I know you'll be able to carve your own path, Rola.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.990
You can do it, Rola!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.990
We'll support you all the way.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.910
Thank you, everyone!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:06:01.250
As Song Class wraps up our fourth day of the 
S4 Selection, the festivities will come to an end.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:06.260
Now I will announce the results of this year's competition.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.720
Song Class, Njjino Yume!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.140
Theater Class, Saotome Ako!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:15.430
Beauty Class, Kasumi Mahiru!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.270
And for Dance Class...

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.520
Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.270
Yay!{this seems excessive}

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:26.030
Nikaidou has won her third consecutive Selection!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.490
Haruka's very very mad!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.780
I even did Aikatsu around the world! {maybe you should've gone to venus ark then}

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:37.500
You really surprised me with how much you've grown!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.500
I say no thank you to your pity!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:45.840
Oh, you know what? I'm graduating anyway, so I'll give you my spot in S4, Haruka!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.970
You're the top idol of Dance Class now.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:54.100
Okay, okay! Haruka takes whatever she can get!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.970
Lucky, lucky! {Aki-lucky!}

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:07.690
The younger girls had me on the ropes, so I'm glad I managed to pull it off.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:11.490
Mahiru-chan, congratulations on your second year at the top of Beauty Class.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.490
Thank you. I only won by a hair.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.370
But it takes a lot to bridge that gap.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.870
I still have a long way to go.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:24.630
Losing simply means you have much room for growth.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.090
Lily-senpai!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.470
The real battle starts now, for both you and myself.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:35.470
Right! I'll keep studying hard and improve my skills as a designer!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.770
That's the spirit, Koharu-chan!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:38.720
Thanks.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.600
By the way, where's Yuzu-senpai?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:48.030
Yuzu is still on stage answering questions from reporters.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.530
Nikaidou-san, congratulations!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.530
How do you feel about your third consecutive win in the S4 Selection?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.530
Please give us a comment.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.290
One at a time, one at a time!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.410
Yuzu-senpai is so brilliant.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.540
She's a shining star.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:07.090
Yuzu is an idol who bestows light upon the world.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.550
What?! Are these all business cards from scouts?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:13.840
That's right!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.430
There's so many!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.260
You could make a playing card deck with this many!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.180
That's what three wins gets you.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.940
Yuzu-senpai, what are you going to do?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.520
Fun is the best!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:30.820
But still, how am I supposed to know which'll be the most fun?

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.660
Yuzu-senpai?

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.950
Get a hold of yourself!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:43.710
Yuzu rarely worries about things, so this is how she ends up whenever she does.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:47.710
You're right. This might be the first time I've ever seen Yuzu-senpai be troubled.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:52.210
I wish I could worry about getting scouted too much. {I hope this is okay and not going to trigger anyone, I'm already avoiding the use of "first world problem"}{something something "nice problem to have" but also I don't think it should trigger but}

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.340
More importantly, will Yuzu-senpai be okay?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:59.510
She'll be fine. Simply cool her head a bit...

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.560
The Tundra Diva!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.730
It's been quite a while!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.480
So hey, what're you gonna do after graduation, Lilienne?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:16.240
I will be advancing into the high school division of Four Star Academy.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:21.160
Several of my dreams were fulfilled during my time in the middle school.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:28.920
I am going to study diligently in the high school in order to answer the expectations of those who have supported me.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.710
The high school's really close, so we'll be able to meet up easily too.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.590
Then after graduation...

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.590
We will part ways.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:47.230
Yuzu, I know you wish for fun Aikatsu 
that allows your heart to dance freely.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.100
Y-Yeah...

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:55.780
Everyone has their own dreams, and some of those require one to leave the nest in order to fly to them.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.490
Just look at Rola-san.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:03.740
Do you understand?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:05.870
Yeah.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.210
Then you must go.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:12.170
The world is calling your name.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.420
Okay. Thanks.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.100
What are the two of you doing here?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.940
Lily-senpai.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.480
We're thinking up ideas for a new dress.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:37.820
When we work together, we come up with really good designs.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.950
You're childhood friends, are you not?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.830
Will you continue to Aikatsu together in the future?

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:47.580
Yes!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.790
I see.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.210
You must feel lonely.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.380
Your best friend is going overseas.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.220
Yuzu's place is out in the world.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:07.140
I always knew the day would come when we must part ways.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.940
Pardon me for interrupting. {sometime between the beginning and end of this scene, all the other girls run away}

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.310
No, you didn't...

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:14.610
Please do your best.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.450
Lily-senpai...

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:41.510
The plan is to feature Nikaidou on next year's high school application pamphlet.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:45.100
Here come the applications from people all around the globe!

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:52.190
With Nikaidou becoming a world idol, the name of 
Four Star Academy will spread to the farthest reaches. {what aobut Hime, Tsubasa, and Yozora?}{not world enough}

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:55.860
So, Nikaidou. Have you decided on your path?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.610
Did you say something?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.950
She wasn't listening...

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.990
I love that independent streak, Nikaidou!

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.120
Take it and blaze your own trail!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.290
What's my own trail, anyway?

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.830
It sounds like fun to travel the world.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.960
But something about it feels wrong.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.960
Oh, that's unexpected.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:21.670
Nikaidou, at times like this you should listen to your heart!

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:23.380
My heart?

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.890
The answer is inside you! {maybe breast}{we could also take the opportunity to translate kokoro as soul to balance out the number of times it gets translated as heart so that the words don't get worn out}

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:32.020
Think back on all the Aikatsu you've done! 
What is it that made your heart dance in joy the most?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.440
Inside my heart...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:39.400
What made it dance in joy the most...

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:45.820
I can't fault you for faltering when faced with so many choices.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:46.870
No matter.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.700
I'll find the most influential agency and—

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:50.660
I got it!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.500
Huh?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:58.250
I just figured out what I want to do!

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.630
H-Hey, wait!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.430
Nobody can stop a raging gale.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.260
Pow!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:18.270
Lilienne!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.730
Yuzu?

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:22.820
I made my decision!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.450
Where will you be heading?

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.370
Four Star Academy High School!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:29.950
Huh?

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.450
I wanna keep on doing Aikatsu with you!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:41.460
I've done a lot of fun things up until now, 
but Aikatsu with you was the most fun of all!{I thought we went over this 'til thing in Aikatsu season 1}{haven't we grown since then?}

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.970
Huh? Did I manage to surprise you, Lilienne?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.100
Ah... yes, I'm surprised.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.930
Yay! I did it!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.230
I surprised Lilienne!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.100
Please wait a moment, Yuzu!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:02.270
What about all the scouts? 
Aren't you going to travel the world?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.820
Even if I stay in Japan, I can still travel whenever I want.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.650
Together with you!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.910
We cannot go together.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:16.710
I'm unable to keep up with you at full speed.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:22.000
I cannot even think to ascend the trees you climb with ease.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.550
I would simply be a hindrance if I went—

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.550
Ready, go!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.470
Yuzu!

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:39.230
If you can't run, I just need to carry you!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.190
But then, you...

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.730
I'm always on the receiving end of your kindness.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.070
This isn't for you.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:49.360
I just want to be with you.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:05.300
Yuzu, it's too dangerous! Please go back down!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.670
I won't back down!

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.880
I'll definitely make it up there with you!

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.930
Are you all right?

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:17.930
Yeah.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.730
You really are amazing.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:35.080
It's the same sunset as always, but being 
with you makes it look way more beautiful.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.330
Aikatsu is more fun together than alone.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:47.130
My heart is shouting that it wants to be with you!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.800
I have already been granted more dreams than I deserve.{this sentence doesn't logically, but it sounds better than "more of my dreams have already been granted than I deserve" so}

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:56.220
Am I really allowed to wish for more?

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:06.440
When one dream comes true, you just need to find an even more fun dream to chase next.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.400
I like that proverb.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.200
What's your heart saying, Lilienne?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.860
Just one thing.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.130
This place is overflowing with reporters.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:31.630
Yuzu-senpai's invitation says that she has an important announcement to make.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.130
There's only one thing that could mean.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.850
She's decided what to do next.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.390
That gets me going!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.890
I can't wait to see where Yuzu-senpai ends up going.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:50.280
Roar! Are you all animaling?! {if she's gonna make up a word, then so am I. I couldn't come up with anything besides animaru}{uh, this is fine though}

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.780
A-Animaling?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:59.620
Animaling. To live in accordance with your instincts as wild animals do,

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.540
and to follow the whims of your feelings.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.370
Lily-senpai?!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.330
Yuzu's gonna animal with Lilienne!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:14.130
In other words, Nikaidou Yuzu and I, 
Shirogane Lily, hereby announce our new unit!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.470
A new unit?!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.760
Our unit name is...

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.350
Yuzu 'n Lily!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:22.100
Yuzu 'n Lily, she says?!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.480
Does that mean you're refusing the offers of all the scouts from around the world?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.190
This opportunity might never come again!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.860
I'll just make my own opportunities.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:35.490
When I'm with Lilienne, I'm unstoppable!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.200
Our hearts are as one.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:42.580
We want to keep doing Aikatsu together!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.330
Fun is the best!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:53.090
Shirogane Lily, pouring my soul into this moment!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.430
Lily-senpai looks so happy.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.060
Yeah, Yuzu-senpai too!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:34.060
Nikaidou, that's a nice smile!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:39.310
Yuzu 'n Lily. This could be the start of a new legend!

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:42.070
A legend! Yes!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:51.160
Hey! I've got a delivery for you, babies!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.750
Elza Beef!

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.580
A whole truckload?!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:00.590
She sent it in celebration of their new unit.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:04.840
Yuzu sent the message telling her to congratulate us!

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:10.100
Yuzu-senpai! We're all ready to roast!{she's really close and the fire is really big}

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:12.310
Fire! Fire!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:13.350
A bonfire?!

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:16.730
Let's all indulge together!

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:20.480
Eat up your fill of steak and animal out!

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.620
Lilienne is my most precious friend.

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:01.080
Doing Aikatsu together is the most fun!

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:04.790
From here on out, we'll embark on a journey towards new Aikatsu!

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:10.050
We'll become Friends and do Aikatsu that are way more fun! {there's so much to unpack here. First, they're Kemono Friends as the animal themed unit. Second, the pair units in next season are called Friends, and Tadokoro Azusa has another leading role, although it's with Oohashi Ayaka and not Ueda Reina}{sounds like we need a TL note}{you got distracted by the note and missed the mistake}

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:12.840
Before the start of a new year...

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:14.300
Before departing on my journey...

